  <ns2:Class rdf:about="https://cropontology.org/rdf/CO_348:3000035">
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Evaluation of the Phoma lingam infection with the G2 score. 
The evaluation occur in the stage G4 of the crop on the collar and on the elongation. Dig out the plant, Realize a cross section at the collar with a pruning, Classify the collars with the rating scale : 1= healthy plant ; 2=0-25% of necrotized surface, 3=25-50% of necrotized surface, 4=50-75% of necrotized surface, 5=75-100% of necrotized surface, 6=plant broke during the evaluation.</ns1:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/Computation"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <ns2:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N93585f3c50ef45a5a1ab96502ec47528">
        <ns2:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/CO_348:2000033"/>
        <ns2:onProperty rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/method_of"/>
      </ns2:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Phoma damage – G2 score – Computation</rdfs:label>
  </ns2:Class>
  <ns2:Class rdf:about="https://cropontology.org/rdf/CO_348:3100001">
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">RootReader2D (RR2D, Clark et al., 2013) was used to analyse images. First, a ‘batch process’ was carried out which automatically ‘thresholds’, ‘skeletonises’ and ‘builds segments’ of all images in bulk. Then, the the root system of individual images was measured by placing a marker at the ase and tip of the primary root. From these markers, RR2D automatically calculates primary root length (PRL), lateral root length(LRL) of all laterals and lateral root number (LRN).</ns1:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <ns2:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N3d69a8c6c7454d80af378730d2dd6a5c">
        <ns2:onProperty rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/method_of"/>
        <ns2:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/CO_348:2100002"/>
      </ns2:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://cropontology.org/rdf/Counting">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/Method"/>
      </rdf:Description>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <ns2:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N7e6f61acf1994fb39c12cf7b823da081">
        <ns2:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/CO_348:2100003"/>
        <ns2:onProperty rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/method_of"/>
      </ns2:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <ns2:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nb552b41407bf41b5a8e9b6bfbb5579d8">
        <ns2:onProperty rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/method_of"/>
        <ns2:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/CO_348:2100001"/>
      </ns2:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Image analysis - Counting</rdfs:label>
  </ns2:Class>
